  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Muhanya Solar Sinda Micro-Grid Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MuhanyaSolar Limited will install a 20 kilowatt solar micro-grid in SindaVillage; in Zambias Eastern Province.The micro-grid will provide energy to 60 families; a school; and small businesses in Sinda;which Muhanyahopes will provide an economic spark for the community and a blueprint for replicable micro-grids in rural areas in Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
